    "A salon for digital fingers. The nail ": {
      "truth": "A salon for digital fingers. The nail color controller offers precise hue selection while color balls scatter like polish bottles on a shelf. Choose a color, apply it to the hand model, watch pigment become identity.",
      "role": "INTRODUCE",
      "id": "C1",
      "act": "Act I",
