    },
    "The grid becomes a canvas. Each cell a": {
      "truth": "The grid becomes a canvas. Each cell awaits its color assignment, a pixel in a larger pattern you construct. The gridcolorizer transforms the floor into a palette - systematic, addressable, yours to paint.",
