    "Walk through light itself. Rainbow emi": {
      "truth": "Walk through light itself. Rainbow emitters line the corridor, cycling through the spectrum in slow waves. Red fades to orange fades to yellow - the continuous gradient made temporal.",
      "role": "DEMONSTRATE",
